msgctxt "0"
msgid "Masochistic Constitution"
msgstr ""

#. max 1999 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "\"Masochism\" refers to being tormented by others,\nand being attacked without cause.\n\nIt's more of a characteristic Passionlip has than an SG.\nRegardless of what Lip does or doesn't want,\nanyone who sees her has their inner sadism stoked\nand picks on Lip for no particular reason.\n\nThough a characteristic akin to a curse,\nwhether she's used to being bullied or simply forgetful,\nLip has the ability to recover from it pretty quickly.\nWhen Alice made fun of her as \"dullwit,\"\nshe wasn't just calling her movements slow,\nbut also meant that she was shameless.\n\n             ◆\n\nPassionlip was born from BB's \"victim side.\"\nShe was born as a vent for desires,\na scapegoat consigned to take the aggression of others.\nIt's unknown if she herself accepts this, but since\nthis SG exists, it's certain that she's ashamed of it.\n\n             ◆\n\nPassionlip is the very picture of a girl who's abused\nby \"violence born from a desire for control.\"\nAs a sacrifice to the desires of the opposite sex.\n\nBut which one can you say is the real victim?\n\nAttracting others without cause, as a trick of the body――\nIs it not the same as a carnivorous plant inviting insects\nto be preyed upon with its sweet nectar?\n"
msgstr ""

